{"4534260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kodama: Slumber of the Gods", "steam_appid": 4534260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Precision Platforming</strong></i><br>Master tight, responsive controls as you leap, dash, and climb through carefully crafted challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fluid Combat</strong></i><br>Slide, stomp, dodge, and jump your way through enemies in fast-paced encounters. Chain your abilities together to outmaneuver foes and stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Awaken the Kami</strong></i><br>Discover ancient statues and awaken gods from Japanese folklore. Unlock new abilities that transform how you explore and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Colorful Hand-Drawn World</strong></i><br>Explore a richly detailed, hand-crafted world inspired by Japanese folklore, brought to life with vibrant environments and hand_drawn animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/ee380f610234a9085f917640c9abf2f3.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No AI &quot;Art&quot;</i></strong><br>All visuals are carefully drawn, with no use of AI-generated art, crafted with passion.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Precision Platforming</strong></i><br>Master tight, responsive controls as you leap, dash, and climb through carefully crafted challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/f2f0fdb50aaa6c3889336e54aae1e5d7.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Fluid Combat</strong></i><br>Slide, stomp, dodge, and jump your way through enemies in fast-paced encounters. Chain your abilities together to outmaneuver foes and stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.poster.avif?t=1780944934\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.webm?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/3c8310c32ef347a1996cf2ff4ea41286.mp4?t=1780944934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Awaken the Kami</strong></i><br>Discover ancient statues and awaken gods from Japanese folklore. Unlock new abilities that transform how you explore and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534260/extras/23a237d98e2a8b4e00c518357fa3fe6b.poster.avif?t=178